<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14715" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρᾱτ-ός</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρητός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀράομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>prayed
				against, accursed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρητὸς γόος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.37
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				24.741
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρατὸν ἕλκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					972
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>prayed for, desirable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				6.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ σωτήριος γνώμη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					656.17
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Abdera</span>): hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρητος, Ἀρήτη,</span> as pr.nn., <i>the Prayed-for,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>: later <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρᾱτος. [ᾱρ</span>
			
				Ep.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰρ</span>
			
				Att.
			]</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
